�Edna mlada zhena e brutalno otvlechena, zatvorena v d'rvena kletka i ostavena na milostta na nast'rveni pl'khove. Tia obache uspiava da se osvobodi sama i otkriva, che pokhititeliat i se e samoubil. Za da iziasniat sluchaia, nekoltsina veshchi politsai osobniatsi nachelo s komisar Kamii Verkhoven tr'gvat po sledite na neinoto minalo i se nat'kvat na zloveshcha zagadka, zad koiato zeiva bezdna ot zlina, nizost, izvratenost i chudovishchno ravnodushie, uvenchani s nepredvidim krai. Nishcho v zapleteniia kriminalen siuzhet ne e cherno-bialo. Rolite na geroite neochakvano se smeniat. Faktite ne se poddavat na ednoznachna interpretatsiia. Aleks - s'blaznitelka, neporasnalo momiche, obrecheno na omraza, palach ili zhertva... Psikhologichesko razsledvane, koeto porazhda moshchnoto v'zdeistvie na romana. Razvr'zkata na intrigata, ot koiato sekva d'kh't, e potresavashcha dori za obr'gnalite politsai."�
�Sky piracy is a bit out of Darian Frey's league. Fate has not been kind to the captain of the airship Ketty Jay--or his motley crew. They are all running from something. Crake is a daemonist in hiding, traveling with an armored golem and burdened by guilt. Jez is the new navigator, desperate to keep her secret from the rest of the crew. Malvery is a disgraced doctor, drinking himself to death. So when an opportunity arises to steal a chest of gems from a vulnerable airship, Frey can't pass it up. It's an easy take--and the payoff will finally make him a rich man.
But when the attack goes horribly wrong, Frey suddenly finds himself the most wanted man in Vardia, trailed by bounty hunters, the elite Century Knights, and the dread queen of the skies, Trinica Dracken. Frey realizes that they've been set up to take a fall but doesn't know the endgame. And the ultimate answer for captain and crew may lie in the legendary hidden pirate town of Retribution Falls. That's if they can get there without getting blown out of the sky."�	
�	A promising young singer is found dead in a clearing in a forest, gruesomely murdered--her larynx cut out, and an antique music box placed carefully atop her body, playing a mysterious lullaby that sounds familiar, but that no one can quite place. Chief Inspector Odd Singsaker, of the Trondheim Police Department, still recovering from brain surgery, is called in to investigate.
Singsaker, now married to Felicia Stone, the American detective he met while tracking down a serial killer, fears the worst when another young girl, also known for her melodic singing voice, suddenly goes missing while on a walk with her dog one night. As the Trondheim police follow the trail of this deadly killer, it becomes clear that both cases are somehow connected to a centuries-old ballad called "The Golden Peace," written by a mysterious composer called Jon Blund, in the seventeenth century. This lullaby promises the most sound, sweet sleep to the listener--and as time ticks by, the elusive killer seems as if he will stop at nothing to get his hands on this perfect lullaby.
Jorgen Brekke returns at the top of his game in this nonstop thrill ride through place--and time."�	
�	Grosmaistor't na kriminalniia zhanr Dzhefri Div'r se zavr'shcha s nov tril'r za Link'ln Raim!
Ameliia Saks e po petite na zapodozrian za ubiistvo v t'rgovski tsent'r, p'len s khora. Tochno togava povreda v edin ot eskalatorite otnema zhivota na sluchaen svidetel. Saks spira da pomogne, a zapodozreniiat se izm'kva. Mezhduvremenno Link'ln Raim se e otteglil ot politsiiata, za da prepodava. V'preki tova toi se zaema da dokazhe tekhnicheskata neizpravnost na eskalatora v s'debnoto delo, zavedeno ot vdovitsata na zhertvata. Ne sled d'lgo Saks i Raim otkrivat, che sluchaite, po koito rabotiat, sa sv'rzani... I che vs'shchnost zlopolukata v t'rgovskiia tsent'r ne e intsident, a p'rvata ataka ot seriia umishleni prest'pleniia.
Dvamata triabva da sprat edin ot nai-trudnite si oponenti do tozi moment - zabelezhitelen ubiets, koito izpolzva uredite i predmetite ot ezhednevieto kato sm'rtonosni or'zhiia. Metodite mu sa nakhodchivi, a toi samiiat izkliuchitelno izobretatelen - koeto go prevr'shcha v edin ot nai-interesnite prest'pnitsi na Div'r!
Dzhefri Div'r e edin ot priznatite maistori v kriminalniia zhanr.
,,Stomanena tseluvka" e 12-iiat mu roman s uchastieto na briliantniia kriminolog Link'ln Raim"�

�
Sl'ntseto izgriava nad Zhiverni...
Ot prozortsite na svoia dom v starata melnitsa edna v'zrastna dama nabliudava zhivota na seltseto, kolite na turistite, siluetite. Liubimoto miasto na Mone e p'lno s gosti, razkhozhdashchi se iz gradinite, v koito toi e risuval svoite vodni lilii. No kogato turistite si zaminat, sluchainiiat posetitel vizhda t'mnata strana na tova inache spokoino miasto.
Istoriiata zapochva s edno brutalno ubiistvo - Zherom Morval, chiiato strast k'm kartinite na velikiia khudozhnik se konkurira edinstveno s's strastta mu k'm zhenite, e nameren m'rt'v. V dzhoba mu e otkrita kartichka za rozhden den s neobichaen nadpis: ,,S'glasen s'm mechtite s's zakon da stanat prest'plenie".
V okoto na buriata se okazvat tri zheni: malko momiche, nadareno s darbata da risuva, izkusitelna uchitelka, koiato mechtae za liubov i kroi planove za biagstvo, i v'zrastna dama s ochi na bukhal, koiato nabliudava i znae vsichko. I razbira se, edna unishchozhitelna strast, koiato slaga nachaloto na poreditsa ot prest'pleniia.
Koi e ubiets't? Kakvo obshcho ima s trite zheni? Slukh ili realnost sa razkazite za skriti ili otkradnati kartini na Mone, sred koito i proslovutite mu ,,Cherni lilii"?
V Zhiverni vseki e enigma i vseki pazi svoiata taina, a dramatichnite istorii razpr'svat iliuziite i s'zhiviavat ranite ot minaloto..."�	
�	Dzhinks d'Iavol otnovo se pribira vk'shchi s's zabelezhka ot uchilishche. Toi ne e kato drugite detsa, v'preki che vlaga vsichki usiliia v tova da se spravia, da b'de normalen. Kolkoto i da se starae da b'de losh, Dzhinks vnimava v chas, slusha uchitelite i dori e dob'r po matematika - malko problemno, kogato si nai-malkiiat sin na Lutsifer. Da ne te biva v zlinite, kogato imeto ti e D'Iavol, e meko kazano losha novina.
Otchaian ot poredniia si proval, Dzhinks biaga ot Pandemonium - ogradeniia s's stena grad na nasilie i adski m'ki, koito naricha svoi dom. No togava popada po sledite na zagovor, koito mozhe da nakara tseliia Ad da se smr'zne. S pomoshchta na malkoto momiche Tomi, popadnala v p'k'la po pogreshka, dvamata triabva da preodoleiat kupishcha nepriiatnosti, da izbegnat stado svirepi kone, da nameriat p'tia v biblioteka-labirint s's skriti kapani i da prekosiat more ot plavashchi pias'tsi, gladni za pl't, predi da stignat do granitsata mezhdu Raia i Ada...
Shche uspeiat li da spasiat selenieto ili balans't mezhdu dvata sviata shche b'de nepopravimo schupen?
"Zhupel za zakuska" ot poreditsata "Dnevnitsite na edin D'Iavol" e istinsko zabavlenie za vseki fen na prikliucheniiata, mitologiiata i "P'rsi Dzhaks'n"."�
�Roman't ,,Inventsiia prima" na Velichka Nastradinova e v izvesten smis'l eksperimentalen. Mnogoplastovostta mu idva ot paradoksalnoto, no erudirano razdvizhvane na zhiteiskite fakti v bogatoto v'obrazhenie na avtor i geroi."�
�Koe kakvo e nauchikh ot khorata.
Koe zashcho e nauchikh ot s'nishchata.
* * *
Biakh se kachil da t'rsia neshcho na tavana,
kogato namerikh tazi mukhliasala kniga.
Prelistikh niakolko stranitsi i zamriakh.
Knigata opisvashe vsichkite mi s'nishcha.
Tova, che ima s'dba, che zhivot't ni e
predopredelen, e absoliutna glupost.
Predopredeleni sa s'nishchata ni."�
�IGRA ZA PETIMA - p'rva kniga ot kriminalnata poreditsata BAR LUME na italianskiia pisatel MARKO MALVALDI
MARKO MALVALDI e roden v Piza prez 1974 g. IGRA ZA PETIMA e p'rvata mu kniga ot poreditsata BAR LUME, s koiato stava izvesten v rodinata si i koiato e uspeshno filmirana.
Glavniiat geroi na poreditsata e mladiiat barman Masimo, na kogoto po nevolia se nalaga da razgadava prest'pleniia, izv'rsheni v krasivata Toskana. Neizmenni zriteli na negovite detektivski lutaniia sa chetirima v'zrastni kibitsi, postoianni posetiteli na bara.
Izp'lnena s italianski khumor i evroppeiski fines, knigata na Malvaldi e priiatno chetivo za vsichki v'zrasti.
Za svoite kriminalni romani Malvaldi e nositel na nagradite Isola d'Elba Awards i Castiglioncello Prize."�
�Prod'lzhenieto na ,,Dov'rshitelkata" e tuk! Edin ot nai-obichanite svetovni avtori prod'lzhava uspeshnata si YA seriia, koiato grabva ot p'rvata stranitsa.
Vega Dzhein i neiniiat priiatel Delf sa vzeli kartata, ostavena im ot Kuentin Kh'rms, i sa izbiagali ot rodnoto si Gorchilishche, tv'rdo resheni da prekosiat Mochurishcheto i da nameriat svoboda ot drugata mu strana. No Mochurishcheto e s'zdadeno spetsialno za da d'rzhi khorata v seloto. To e p'lno s kr'vozhadni s'shchestva i zloveshchi magii i niama da im pozvoli da se izm'knat beznakazano. Vega Dzhein triabva otkrie skritite si zalozhbi, da pobedi novi vragove i da nameri priiateli, ako iska da otkrie istinata za Gorchilishche i Mochurishcheto.
Ochakva vi neveroiatno prikliuchenie, izp'lneno s opasnosti, naprezhenie i neochakvani obrati v dukha na shed'ovri kato ,,Vlastelin't na pr'stenite", ,,Khari Pot'r" i ,,Igrite na glada"."	
